My opinion? I think you're going to get all kinds of vehement
opposition to this suggestion, but I think the idea should be
considered. Here are a few things that spring into my head:

-Time the Devteam spent working on a multi-dungeon nethack is time
that could go into adding features to the nethack we already know and
love.

-On the other hand, it doens't necessarily have to be the devteam that
does the work. There are plenty of coders in the NH community, and it
wouldn't be the first time the game has spawned an offshoot.

-Not everyone here has tried ADOM or other roguelikes, and so don't
feel the pressure of the competition: I've never played anything
except nh and [s], and I'm perfectly happy with them as they are.

-That said, if a multi-dungeon nh were to appear for download, I'd
almost certainly want to try it out.

